**Last Updated:** September 2025 

بسم الله الرحمن الرحيم 

## 1. Acceptance 
By using Sunnah Al-Hadi, you agree to these terms. 

---

## 2. Purpose 
This app provides authentic Sunnahs from the life of Prophet Muhammad ﷺ for educational and spiritual guidance. 

---

## 3. Content Disclaimer 
- All content is compiled from authentic Islamic sources. 
- Users should consult qualified Islamic scholars for important religious decisions. 
- Content is provided *“as is”* for educational purposes. 

---

## 4. User Responsibilities 
- Use the app respectfully and in accordance with Islamic principles. 
- Do not misuse or redistribute the content inappropriately. 
- Respect the sacred nature of the content. 

---

## 5. Intellectual Property 
- Hadith and Sunnah content are from public Islamic sources. 
- App design and compilation are the intellectual property of the developer. 
- Users may share content for **dawah (Islamic outreach)** purposes. 

---

## 6. Prohibited Uses 
- Commercial use without permission. 
- Modifying or misrepresenting the content. 
- Using content in ways contrary to Islamic teachings. 

---

## 7. Limitation of Liability 
This app is provided as a service to the Muslim community. The developer is not liable for decisions made based solely on app content. 

---

## 8. Religious Guidance 
For important religious matters, always consult qualified Islamic scholars. 

---

## 9. Termination 
We reserve the right to discontinue the app or remove it from app stores at any time. 

---

## 10. Governing Principles 
These terms are guided by Islamic principles of justice (*Adl*) and good faith (*Husn al-Qada*). 

---

## 11. Contact 
For questions about these terms, please contact: 
 sarfraz.ilanos1915@gmail.com 

بارك الله فيكم 
